{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04960","headline":"兴庆池侍宴应制 · 马怀素","name":"兴庆池侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积水逶迤绕直城，[含]虚皎镜有余清。\n图云曲榭连缇幕，映日中塘间彩旌。\n赏洽犹闻箫管沸，欢留更睹木兰轻。\n无劳海上寻仙客，即此蓬莱在帝京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马怀素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}